 "stimulus_html": "<figure>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/50f3918aafcba2a5.png\" alt=\"A woman stands in front of an American flag and holds a laurel wreath. The poster reads, “Americans All!” It includes a list of names under the title “Honor Roll”: DuBois, Smith, O’Brien, Cejka, Haucke, Pappandrikopolous, Andrassi, Villotto, Levy, Turovich, Kowalski, Chriczanevicz, Knutson, Gonzales. Victory Liberty Loan.”\">\n<figcaption>A 1919 poster of an allegorical America, standing in front of the flag and holding a wreath over an “honor roll” listing soldiers who died in action.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p><i>Refer to the image provided.</i></p>",
 "questions": [
